OL,3,ACornell frat house rape accuser 'under
OL,4,Asiege' online, says lawyer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe lawyer for the woman who alleges
OL,7,Fshe was raped at a Cornell University
OL,8,Ffraternity house says she is "not doing
OL,9,Fwell" as she finds herself "under
OL,10,Fsiege" from online sleuths seeking to
OL,11,Fidentity her.
OL,13,FThomas Giuffra said the woman known in
OL,14,Flegal documents as Jane Doe was
OL,15,F"incapable of consent" because she was
OL,16,F"completely, grossly intoxicated" when
OL,17,Fshe turned up at the home where she
OL,18,Fsays the assault took place.
OL,20,FThe woman alleges she was assaulted by
OL,21,Fseven men at the campus in Ithaca, New
OL,22,FYork, in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
